    "base_url: POST https://ai-gateway.vercel.sh/v1/chat/completions without a key answered 401 (2026-10-02): the endpoint exists",
    "env_key AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY: named in the docs page (2026-10-02)",
    "a gateway: model ids are vendor/model and the behaviour depends on the upstream; survey two upstreams (an OpenAI model and an open model) as plain and reasoner",
    "models: pick the roles with `survey.py models <id> --env-file ../.env` once a key exists; delete this list when confirmed."
